{
  "id": "introduction-qui-es-tu",
  "category": "introduction",
  "subgroup": null,
  "subgroup_label": "",
  "title": "🇸🇰 Introduction — Qui es-tu?",
  "image": null,
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "En slovaque, comme en français, il y a un **tu** (tutoiement) et un **vous** (vouvoiement). C'est important de savoir les distinguer dès le départ, surtout pour bien saluer les gens ! 😊"
    },
    {
      "type": "hr"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "1. Deux façons de dire bonjour"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Deux salutations essentielles en slovaque :"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Le \"salut\" décontracté"
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Ahoj!",
      "speaker": null,
      "natural": "Salut !",
      "literal": [],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Le \"bonjour\" formel"
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Dobrý deň!",
      "speaker": null,
      "natural": "Bonjour !",
      "literal": [
        "Dobrý deň = bon jour"
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "type": "hr"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "2. Faire connaissance"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "L'échange"
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Dobrý deň! Vitajte! Ja som Andrea.",
      "speaker": "👩",
      "natural": "Bonjour ! Bienvenue ! Je m'appelle Andrea.",
      "literal": [
        "Ja = moi",
        "som = je suis"
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Ako sa voláte?",
      "speaker": "👩",
      "natural": "Comment vous appelez-vous ?",
      "literal": [
        "Ako sa voláte = comment vous vous appelez (forme de politesse)"
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Volám sa [ASK_USER_NAME].",
      "speaker": "👤",
      "natural": "Je m'appelle [dis-nous ton prénom].",
      "literal": [
        "Volám sa = je m'appelle"
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Teší ma, [USER_NAME]! Som rada.",
      "speaker": "👩",
      "natural": "Enchantée, [USER_NAME] ! Je suis heureuse !",
      "literal": [
        "Teší ma = enchanté(e) (formule de politesse, valable au tutoiement comme au vouvoiement)",
        "Som rada = je suis heureuse (une femme dirait \"rada\", un homme \"rád\")"
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "type": "hr"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "3. Les formules de politesse essentielles"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Dire merci"
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Ďakujem.",
      "speaker": null,
      "natural": "Merci.",
      "literal": [
        "Ďakujem = je remercie (c'est la forme principale)"
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Ďakujem pekne!",
      "speaker": null,
      "natural": "Merci beaucoup !",
      "literal": [
        "pekne = joliment / bien"
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Dire au revoir"
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Dovidenia!",
      "speaker": null,
      "natural": "Au revoir !",
      "literal": [
        "Dovidenia = jusqu'à ce qu'on se revoie (forme neutre, courante)"
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Ahoj!",
      "speaker": null,
      "natural": "Salut ! (aussi utilisé pour dire au revoir entre proches)",
      "literal": [],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Dire \"excusez-moi\""
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Prepáčte!",
      "speaker": null,
      "natural": "Excusez-moi ! (vouvoiement)",
      "literal": [
        "Prepáčte = pardonnez"
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "type": "audio-card",
      "phrase": "Prepáč!",
      "speaker": null,
      "natural": "Excuse-moi ! (tutoiement)",
      "literal": [
        "Prepáč = pardonne"
      ],
      "notes": []
    }
  ]
}